# Backend (`apps/api`)

NestJS + TypeORM + PostgreSQL ([stack](../../docs/tech-stack.md) §3). HTTP, worker, and TTL cron — **one process** (no Redis in v1). Modules & storage — [architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §3.2–3.3. API & limits — [task](../../docs/technical-task.md) §7.

## Modules

`auth`, `users`, `api-keys`, `jobs`, `files`, `shares`, `conversion`, `storage`, `worker`, `cleanup`, `telegram` (mock), `common`.

## Jobs & files

- `POST` job → validate MIME/size/format pair → file to `storage/uploads/` → `ConversionJob` `queued` → `202 { id, status }` ([architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §4.1).
- Worker: `queued` → `processing` → Sharp/LibreOffice → `results/` → `completed` | `failed` ([stack](../../docs/tech-stack.md) §4).
- Check MIME via **magic bytes** (`file-type`), not extension alone ([task](../../docs/technical-task.md) §2.3).
- One file per job; max 10 MB; engine timeout 60s ([task](../../docs/technical-task.md) §2.2).
- No path traversal in `storage`. Serve files **only** via signed download / API key / share-token — never static `storage/` ([architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §3.3).

## Auth & API

Brief; full security checklist — [security.mdc](./security.mdc).

- `/api/auth/*` — JWT cookie (httpOnly); passwords — **argon2** ([architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §4.2).
- `/api/v1/*` — `X-API-Key` (hash + prefix in DB).
- Rate limit — `@nestjs/throttler` ([task](../../docs/technical-task.md) §7.6).
- Telegram in v1 — **mock module**, no live Bot API ([stack](../../docs/tech-stack.md) §6).

## TTL (cleanup cron)

| What | TTL |
| ---- | --- |
| uploads | until job ends or max 1h |
| results (non-profile) | 24h |
| share | 7 days (default) |
| signed download | 15 min |

Details — [architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §4.3 and [task](../../docs/technical-task.md) §2.2. If `save_conversions = true` → result to `storage/profile/` + `StoredFile`.
